WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.600
I guess it has to be a person.

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:08.370
I'm truly sorry.

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:12.260
Shuri!

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:17.070
Stop!

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:23.660
...then this time, I'll be the one pulling your hand.

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:36.640
<b>Confession</b>

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:42.430
Yes, please come in.

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:45.480
Hidaka-kun.

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:48.490
Ah, just stay as you were.

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:51.220
Here.

00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:54.370
What lovely flowers. Thank you.

00:00:54.740 --> 00:00:56.220
And this too.

00:00:56.220 --> 00:00:58.030
I figured you won't have much to do while hospitalised.

00:00:58.490 --> 00:01:00.480
A detective novel?

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:05.110
Yeah. Aoi-chan recommended it. It's very good.

00:01:05.110 --> 00:01:08.510
Thanks. I was just starting to get bored.

00:01:08.910 --> 00:01:12.280
If you're starting to get bored, that means you're getting better then.

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:13.720
Perhaps.

00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:17.050
Although, my injury wasn't that serious in the first place.

00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:22.010
But, the doctor said that if the wound was any deeper, you'd be in critical condition.

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:25.340
Doctors always say those kinda things anyway.

00:01:25.340 --> 00:01:29.440
They didn't need to bandage my head like this either.

00:01:29.920 --> 00:01:35.850
But going for a hospital visit, and ending up being hospitalised... Kinda makes you laugh, doesn't it?

00:01:36.730 --> 00:01:41.450
Perhaps my suffering really is punishment from god.

00:01:41.450 --> 00:01:46.260
What are you saying? You didn't do anything to deserve punishment.

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:50.200
The letter...

00:01:51.490 --> 00:01:56.170
The one about seeing Shuri and Shuusuke-kun enter a love hotel.

00:01:56.910 --> 00:01:58.670
The letter betraying them.

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:02.350
I sent that letter.

00:02:18.710 --> 00:02:20.150
Surprised?

00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:25.840
I was feigning ignorance, even though I was the perpetrator.

00:02:26.350 --> 00:02:28.900
It's only natural that I got punished for this.

00:02:28.900 --> 00:02:31.630
Why? Why did you do...?

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:34.220
When I was in Year 1...

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:36.120
...I confessed to Shuri.

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:38.570
Confessed?

00:02:38.570 --> 00:02:41.810
Obviously, I was turned down.

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:48.150
I met Shuri during the middle school entrance ceremony.

00:02:48.620 --> 00:02:52.040
Shuri was always so cheerful and open.

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:54.450
The complete opposite of me.

00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:58.760
Since I was a kid, I always pretended to be a good girl.

00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:02.040
I always responded appropriately to the teachers' expressions.

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:04.680
I wondered how to get Shuri to like me.

00:03:05.560 --> 00:03:09.400
I was an awful child, always thinking about such things.

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:13.380
No, even now, I'm an awful woman.

00:03:13.710 --> 00:03:15.240
How could you say that?

00:03:15.240 --> 00:03:17.830
It's okay. You don't have to comfort me.

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:21.860
I know very well who I am.

00:03:21.860 --> 00:03:22.870
But...

00:03:23.480 --> 00:03:25.930
...I'm sick of acting that way.

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:28.890
Suffocated by the mask of a good child.

00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:33.800
Sometimes, I wonder who's the real me.

00:03:34.630 --> 00:03:36.300
So, during those times...

00:03:36.990 --> 00:03:39.410
...Shuri shines so brightly.

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:44.820
I thought, perhaps Shuri would accept me as I am.

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:50.510
Thinking like that, I could no longer suppress my feelings.

00:03:50.510 --> 00:03:52.080
Then...

00:03:52.360 --> 00:03:55.190
At first, she asked if I was joking.

00:03:55.970 --> 00:04:02.180
However, when she realised that I was serious, her expression turned solemn and she said, "Sorry".

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:09.860
Then she said, "Asami, I can't accept your feelings. However, let's continue being friends like always."

00:04:11.850 --> 00:04:14.670
A stereotypical rejection, isn't it?

00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:21.570
At that moment, I thought that there was no way I could pretend as if nothing happened.

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:26.620
I probably wouldn't even speak to her tomorrow, much less remain friends.

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:28.610
At least that's what I thought.

00:04:28.610 --> 00:04:29.950
But...

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:34.300
...the next day, Shuri would call out to me as always.

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:36.890
As if nothing had ever happened.

00:04:37.680 --> 00:04:41.750
I knew that it was due to her kindness.

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:49.530
But, it made me feel as if my feelings towards Shuri never existed.

00:04:49.950 --> 00:04:53.650
Since then, I've hated Shuri.

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:59.020
Every time she acted normally towards me would be like another wound inflicted on me.

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:02.080
I hated her so much.

00:05:02.590 --> 00:05:08.230
Honestly, it would probably have been better if I had been frank with her about how I felt back then.

00:05:08.230 --> 00:05:12.080
If I had done so, then all this would surely have never happened.

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:15.830
But, I just couldn't do it.

00:05:16.980 --> 00:05:22.070
I hated Shuri, but I still wanted to be her friend.

00:05:22.070 --> 00:05:26.660
In truth, I was scared of losing her.

00:05:26.660 --> 00:05:31.520
I didn't care if it was a façade. I pretended to be her friend.

00:05:31.520 --> 00:05:34.020
It all went well for a while.

00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:38.000
Because I was used to hiding my feelings.

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:43.140
Just like Shuri, I acted as if the 
confession had never happened.

00:05:43.140 --> 00:05:46.290
So, I went out with her like a normal friend.

00:05:46.290 --> 00:05:50.030
Nearing the first year of being in self-denial...

00:05:50.030 --> 00:05:53.280
...it started to feel as if it was real.

00:05:53.280 --> 00:05:58.970
"This is good. Shuri and I are truly best friends."

00:05:58.970 --> 00:06:03.690
Just as I was starting to believe that there was no bad blood between us...

00:06:05.030 --> 00:06:06.470
...but on that day...

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:10.400
...when we all went to the theme park and while we were riding the Ferris wheel...

00:06:10.910 --> 00:06:13.640
That was the first time I saw Shuri like that.

00:06:14.250 --> 00:06:18.870
A face that she would never show me. 
A face that only Shuusuke-kun would ever see.

00:06:19.380 --> 00:06:21.190
I realised when I saw that!

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:26.510
I realised that they shared a profound wound.

00:06:26.510 --> 00:06:29.520
And there was no room left in there for me.

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:32.160
In spite of that, I...

00:06:33.180 --> 00:06:38.920
...wanted to be accepted by Shuri. My mind was engrossed in that thought.

00:06:38.920 --> 00:06:44.240
I confessed like an idiot and only ended up hurting myself.

00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:48.830
Each and every day, there would be wretched feelings lying at the bottom of my heart.

00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:55.030
When I thought of that, I suddenly lost control.

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:59.150
All the feelings I had been suppressing came bursting out.

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:03.870
"They should suffer."

00:07:04.380 --> 00:07:07.280
"No, I'll show you my suffering."

00:07:09.290 --> 00:07:12.800
I made up a scandal which would deceive people of their relationship.

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:16.790
So that they may never again be close in front of people.

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:18.410
Hoshino-san...

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:25.350
Shuri told me about their mother's death anniversary and that they were going to visit her grave together.

00:07:25.350 --> 00:07:27.300
I saw that day as a good opportunity.

00:07:29.280 --> 00:07:32.760
If I send the letter saying that they were seen entering a love hotel...

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:39.810
...and if they can't prove that they went some place else, then they wouldn't be able to dispel the suspicions.

00:07:40.300 --> 00:07:44.700
I knew that it would cause a huge stir if I did so.

00:07:44.700 --> 00:07:46.740
Even if the allegations had no basis...

00:07:46.740 --> 00:07:52.330
...Shuri's father, the town councillor, would surely be displeased with rumours spreading.

00:07:53.590 --> 00:07:57.080
You know, I'm good at thinking up malicious stuff.

00:07:57.750 --> 00:08:04.470
During elementary school, I would plot in my head against my hated teachers and classmates.

00:08:04.470 --> 00:08:08.220
I would think of ways to make myself not look like the perpetrator.

00:08:08.220 --> 00:08:11.090
I would imagine the problems that they'd face.

00:08:11.360 --> 00:08:15.900
I would conjure many, many, many things in my head.

00:08:16.500 --> 00:08:20.020
However, I only began to realise what I was doing when that happened.

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:22.470
It's a rather strange feeling.

00:08:22.470 --> 00:08:25.200
At the time when I was typing out the letter on the PC...

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:28.260
...and when I put it into the mail box...

00:08:28.260 --> 00:08:32.520
...I would always believe that what I was doing was imaginary.

00:08:32.520 --> 00:08:34.620
I didn't think that it was real.

00:08:34.620 --> 00:08:41.820
The same goes for when I went to school before everyone else and drew the love umbrella.

00:08:42.980 --> 00:08:46.870
Before the first period, I wanted to take a look at how things went.

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:50.990
And exactly at that moment, Shuri came rushing out from the classroom and bumped into me.

00:08:50.990 --> 00:08:54.280
I think Shuri was in tears then.

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:57.420
However, I didn't regret it.

00:08:58.210 --> 00:09:05.020
Rather, I was trembling with excitement consoling her in the bus on the way to the hospital.

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:07.470
"Suffer more."

00:09:07.470 --> 00:09:12.140
I wanted her to show me the face she could only show Shuusuke-kun.

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:15.850
I was thinking along those lines, but...

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:18.120
But at that time...

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:22.700
...when I saw Shuri in danger, I
 immediately leapt in front of her.

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:27.610
Why did I do that? I'm supposed to hate her.

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:29.970
Why?

00:09:33.160 --> 00:09:36.010
That's obvious, isn't it?

00:09:37.790 --> 00:09:40.020
It's because, that's the real you.

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:44.870
No matter how much you wanted to hate her...

00:09:44.870 --> 00:09:48.670
...you just couldn't keep still when you saw Shuri in danger.

00:09:48.670 --> 00:09:50.660
You thought, "I have to save her!"

00:09:50.660 --> 00:09:54.960
You thought that you had to save the person precious to you, even if it means sacrificing yourself.

00:09:54.960 --> 00:09:59.040
Because, that's how you really feel!

00:09:59.590 --> 00:10:01.030
Hidaka-kun...

00:10:02.460 --> 00:10:07.370
If you say it like that, then I...

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:20.330
Sana, you came!

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:23.850
Hoshino-san, it's Shuu and Shuri.

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:24.820
How are you?

00:10:24.820 --> 00:10:27.140
Business is booming today, isn't it?

00:10:27.140 --> 00:10:29.030
You look well. That's good.

00:10:29.030 --> 00:10:30.330
Thanks.

00:10:30.330 --> 00:10:31.580
Here, a get well gift.

00:10:31.580 --> 00:10:35.380
It's pudding. The doctor said that soft stuff should be okay.

00:10:35.380 --> 00:10:37.600
I'm so happy. I'll help myself to some then.

00:10:37.600 --> 00:10:39.400
You're really well already!

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:46.350
This pudding is my favourite.

00:10:46.350 --> 00:10:48.890
Really? That's good.

00:10:52.970 --> 00:10:57.780
Look at the time! Asami, we have to go now.

00:10:57.780 --> 00:11:00.190
I feel bad for taking so much of your time.

00:11:02.130 --> 00:11:05.270
Thank you for today. Thank you too Shuusuke-kun.

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:07.600
See you then.
-Take care.

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:12.360
Wait.

00:11:14.490 --> 00:11:17.990
I'd like to speak with Shuri in private.

00:11:18.380 --> 00:11:21.480
Sorry, but could you leave us two alone?

00:11:24.260 --> 00:11:27.780
What's this about? Some girl secret?

00:11:27.780 --> 00:11:30.700
Okay, Shuri, we'll be in the courtyard.

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:32.590
When you're done, please come over.

00:11:32.590 --> 00:11:34.440
Yep, got it.

00:11:45.420 --> 00:11:48.010
They're sure taking their time.

00:11:48.010 --> 00:11:51.250
Girls sure have a lot of things to talk about.

00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:53.560
I wonder what they're talking about.

00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:54.910
Beats me.

00:11:57.500 --> 00:11:59.120
By the way, Sana.

00:11:59.120 --> 00:12:01.150
How are you doing with Nanaka?

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:03.930
What do you mean?

00:12:03.930 --> 00:12:07.910
You know, after we went to the theme park, Nanaka...

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:10.780
...has had a more gentle expression or something.

00:12:10.780 --> 00:12:13.980
Like she isn't forcing herself so much anymore.

00:12:13.980 --> 00:12:16.620
So, I was wondering if something happened.

00:12:18.010 --> 00:12:21.480
Well, nothing really happened actually.

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:23.240
It's just...

00:12:23.240 --> 00:12:24.120
Just?

00:12:24.120 --> 00:12:28.370
Nah, it was during the Ferris wheel ride.

00:12:29.020 --> 00:12:31.570
Hurry and spill it!

00:12:31.570 --> 00:12:36.280
Well, I wasn't there for her during her darkest moments.

00:12:36.280 --> 00:12:40.920
So, to make up for that, I told her that I'd be with her forever from now on.

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:43.050
So that's what you told Nanaka?

00:12:43.050 --> 00:12:44.480
Yeah.

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:47.400
Does it sound conceited?

00:12:47.400 --> 00:12:50.500
Be with her forever, eh?

00:12:51.610 --> 00:12:53.510
It's definitely conceited.

00:12:55.180 --> 00:12:57.820
But, I think what you said was great.

00:12:57.820 --> 00:12:59.110
Shuu.

00:13:02.030 --> 00:13:03.560
Finally, she's here.

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:08.830
Sis?

00:13:11.800 --> 00:13:14.940
Shuusuke, I...

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:18.230
Hey, what in the world happened there?

00:13:37.720 --> 00:13:39.010
I'm back.

00:13:43.090 --> 00:13:44.430
Saeko?

00:13:45.870 --> 00:13:47.020
Saeko?

00:13:47.390 --> 00:13:49.200
She's not here?

00:13:49.800 --> 00:13:51.880
Shuri, where's Saeko?

00:13:51.880 --> 00:13:53.970
She'll be late because of a class reunion.

00:13:53.970 --> 00:13:56.190
Class reunion?

00:13:56.190 --> 00:13:57.810
Wasn't that last week?

00:13:57.810 --> 00:14:00.960
Last week was the high school reunion. This one is for middle school.

00:14:00.960 --> 00:14:02.250
Really?

00:14:06.470 --> 00:14:10.360
Oh yeah. Your departure date to London has been confirmed.

00:14:10.360 --> 00:14:12.020
It's this Saturday.

00:14:12.020 --> 00:14:15.080
One of the workers will take you to the airport in the morning.

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:17.350
Make sure you get your bags packed before then.

00:14:19.520 --> 00:14:21.090
Where are you going?

00:14:21.090 --> 00:14:23.130
I'm going to pack my bags.

00:14:23.130 --> 00:14:24.380
I see.

00:14:30.450 --> 00:14:31.700
I'm coming in.

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:37.810
My departure date has been confirmed.

00:14:38.180 --> 00:14:39.810
It's next Saturday.

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:42.900
I see. So, before then...

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:45.680
Say, Shuusuke, it's still not too late.

00:14:45.680 --> 00:14:49.010
Sis, I'll get angry if you say anymore.

00:14:49.470 --> 00:14:52.000
Okay. I won't bring it up anymore.

00:14:52.000 --> 00:14:54.800
But, let me at least say one word.

00:14:54.800 --> 00:14:56.000
What is it?

00:14:56.880 --> 00:14:58.310
Thanks.

00:15:01.370 --> 00:15:05.130
What? You're going to be studying in London? Why so suddenly?

00:15:05.530 --> 00:15:09.240
Well, you know. A lot has happened to me recently.

00:15:09.240 --> 00:15:12.760
And it'd be a problem if strange rumours started spreading.

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:15.160
My parents decided for me.

00:15:15.160 --> 00:15:18.650
How could that happen? You never did anything bad.

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:22.800
Either way, if rumours spread, the situation will turn ugly.

00:15:22.800 --> 00:15:25.350
The city council elections are coming soon as well.

00:15:26.370 --> 00:15:27.750
That's terrible.

00:15:27.750 --> 00:15:31.550
He's sending you off for that reason and not even considering your feelings.

00:15:31.550 --> 00:15:34.140
Yeah, it's terrible, isn't it?

00:15:40.900 --> 00:15:46.360
But, even though you're going to London, it's not like we'll never see each other again.

00:15:46.360 --> 00:15:51.270
Yeah. This isn't an eternal farewell, right?

00:15:51.270 --> 00:15:52.560
Right?

00:16:09.830 --> 00:16:13.770
Okay, everyone to your seats.

00:16:16.360 --> 00:16:20.020
Where are the Wakatsuki twins? They came this morning didn't they?

00:16:22.010 --> 00:16:24.090
Are they cutting class?

00:16:24.090 --> 00:16:29.880
How hopeless. They could have told me if they're cutting class.

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:34.140
We left off at page 38, right?

00:16:34.140 --> 00:16:37.420
No, sensei, we're at page 36.

00:16:37.420 --> 00:16:39.810
Oh, is that right?

00:16:43.720 --> 00:16:46.310
<i>Where did Shuu and Shuri go?</i>

00:16:47.930 --> 00:16:49.110
<i>Going somewhere?</i>

00:16:49.110 --> 00:16:54.640
Yeah. This isn't an eternal farewell, right?

00:16:56.360 --> 00:16:59.550
Be with her forever, eh?

00:17:00.380 --> 00:17:02.420
I think what you said was great.

00:17:02.420 --> 00:17:03.860
<i>Don't tell me!</i>

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:05.710
Sensei!

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:06.540
Yes?

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:09.460
Hidaka Sana of class 2-F leaving early.

00:17:10.940 --> 00:17:12.390
Hey!

00:17:14.090 --> 00:17:15.480
Hey!

00:17:18.900 --> 00:17:21.890
<i>Perhaps what Shuu meant was...</i>

00:17:23.070 --> 00:17:25.750
<i>Be with her forever, eh?</i>

00:17:42.560 --> 00:17:44.640
Sorry to keep you.

00:17:44.640 --> 00:17:46.770
What's with those sunglasses?

00:17:48.300 --> 00:17:53.160
Well, wearing these would make it look like we're really running away, I guess.

00:17:55.330 --> 00:17:58.990
You got my bags from the coin locker too.

00:18:00.290 --> 00:18:02.420
Sis, where's the uniform you changed from?

00:18:02.420 --> 00:18:05.750
I left it in the restroom. After all, I don't need it anymore.

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:07.750
You actually brought yours.

00:18:13.570 --> 00:18:18.990
When they get together and realise that we're not there, I wonder what they'll say.

00:18:18.990 --> 00:18:22.550
They would probably be like, "The twins disappeared without a trace."

00:18:22.550 --> 00:18:25.470
I don't really care about that.

00:18:25.470 --> 00:18:28.460
My, what's with that stern face?

00:18:28.760 --> 00:18:34.030
That look on your face makes it feel like we're not running away, but doing a lover's suicide.

00:18:36.810 --> 00:18:39.540
Are you regretting this?

00:18:39.540 --> 00:18:40.700
How could I?

00:18:40.700 --> 00:18:43.660
Then, are you worried about what comes after?

00:18:43.660 --> 00:18:46.440
Are you not worried?

00:18:46.440 --> 00:18:47.600
Not at all.

00:18:49.350 --> 00:18:52.550
Because, Shuusuke, I have you.

00:18:54.220 --> 00:18:55.330
Right.

00:19:03.800 --> 00:19:05.190
Hey, you!

00:19:07.730 --> 00:19:09.820
Shuu! Shuri!

00:19:11.440 --> 00:19:12.870
Shuu! Shuri!

00:19:12.870 --> 00:19:13.840
You.

00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:15.090
Let go!

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:16.810
Buy a ticket if you're getting on.

00:19:16.810 --> 00:19:20.650
You won't be able to make it on that one.

00:19:25.460 --> 00:19:27.180
Ah, dammit!

00:19:33.290 --> 00:19:38.010
Oh my, Sana-chan. It's dangerous to dash out so suddenly.

00:19:38.010 --> 00:19:39.490
And what about school?

00:19:39.490 --> 00:19:41.020
Auntie, forgive me!

00:19:41.020 --> 00:19:41.940
Yes?

00:19:54.950 --> 00:19:56.890
Sana noticed.

00:19:56.890 --> 00:20:01.430
Yeah. Normally, he's really slow; except for this time.

00:20:03.420 --> 00:20:05.460
Shuusuke, look!

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:23.650
Shuu! No matter where you are...!

00:20:23.650 --> 00:20:27.170
The train is too noisy to catch what he's saying, right?

00:20:27.170 --> 00:20:29.210
No, I do know.

00:20:31.380 --> 00:20:33.510
I know.

00:20:34.070 --> 00:20:35.780
Because...

00:20:41.200 --> 00:20:42.580
Sana!

00:20:43.560 --> 00:20:49.530
No matter where you are, we'll always be friends!

00:20:49.530 --> 00:20:53.830
We'll always be friends!

00:21:25.720 --> 00:21:32.150
Just when Sana-chan came back. I can't believe Shuu-chan and Shuri-chan have left this time.

00:21:32.150 --> 00:21:38.870
I was hoping that the five of us could have fun like we did when we were kids.

00:21:38.870 --> 00:21:43.500
Hey, Aoi, don't be so depressed. You have to do the preview.

00:21:43.500 --> 00:21:44.420
But...

00:21:44.420 --> 00:21:46.320
You're so helpless.

00:21:46.320 --> 00:21:50.580
Next time on Myself; Yourself: Red Memories.

00:21:49.160 --> 00:21:55.030
Red Memories

00:21:50.580 --> 00:21:52.750
Please watch next week too.

00:21:52.750 --> 00:21:54.610
Promise mummy.
